\par
Director General Charles Chi-Yu Chou accepted the Proclamation and expressed gratitude to the Commission for this recognition. He highlighted the positive benefits of the Sister Cities relationship between Kaohsiung City in Taiwan and the City. Tina Wong Cordon, Chairwoman of the Kaohsiung City Sister Cities program, discussed Taiwan's contributions and provided additional information. Mayor Trantalis reflected on his visit to Kaohsiung City in 2018. Russell Weaver, President of Greater Fort Lauderdale Sister Cities International, commented on the favorable aspects of the City's relationship with Taiwan through the Sister Cities International program.\par
