\par
Fire-Rescue Department Deputy Chief Chantal Botting thanked the Commission for the recognizing the Department's fire prevention efforts. She discussed this year's \i Fire Prevention Week\i0 initiative led by Fire Marshal Jason Miller, which emphasized the importance of lithium-ion battery safety education. \par
\par
Deputy Chief Botting commented on related community outreach activities, including an annual digital art and essay contest for elementary school students that focuses on lithium-ion battery fire safety. Fire Marshal Miller announced the winners of this contest who were selected by members of the Fort Lauderdale Fire-Rescue Department.\par
}

