{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs24 Commissioner Glassman said that the proposed Transfer of Development Rights (TDR) Ordinance is a complex issue requiring careful consideration and remarked on numerous discussions with professionals in the field, City staff, and community stakeholders to ensure the Ordinance would be fair and effective for all parties. The Ordinance requires additional refinement and minor adjustments and requested a deferral to allow more time for review and improvement.\par
\par
Mayor Trantalis expressed concern, noting that the City had been addressing this matter for several years and expounded on his perspective. Further comment and discussion ensued regarding a deferral timeline. \par
\par
